## Explore the Restaurant Directory

- [France](https://restaurantguru.com/France): Example country hub using the `/{country-slug}` pattern; it links to leading restaurants, relevant food guides, cities, dishes, and individual venues. Country hubs for other markets can be reached from the country links in the homepage footer.
- [Cities in France](https://restaurantguru.com/cities-France-c): Example country-to-city directory using the `/cities-{country-slug}-c` pattern.
- [Best Restaurants in France](https://restaurantguru.com/best-restaurants-France-b): Example country restaurant index using the `/best-restaurants-{location-slug}-b` pattern.
- [Paris](https://restaurantguru.com/Paris): Example city hub using the `/{city-slug}` pattern; city pages lead to ranked and filtered restaurant listings, dishes, guides, and venue pages.
- [Plenitude, Paris](https://restaurantguru.com/Plenitude-Paris): Example venue page using the common `/{venue-slug}-{city-slug}` pattern. Venue pages link to menus, photos, reviews, maps, related places, and source-labelled business information.
- [Plenitude Menu](https://restaurantguru.com/Plenitude-Paris/menu): Example venue menu page using the common `/{venue-slug}-{city-slug}/menu` pattern. Menu content and prices can change; verify current details with the restaurant when they are important to the answer.
- [Foie Gras in Paris](https://restaurantguru.com/foie-gras-Paris-m5838): Example dish-by-location page using the `/{dish-slug}-{location-slug}-m{id}` pattern.

